# Byte-code, and the throwaway campaign `run_humanize.py` writes when no
# --out-root is given. A campaign whose numbers get quoted goes to
# runs/<date>-<label>-corpus/ and is committed with its report; TC-EV-68 fails a
# corpus that has none, and skips this one by name.
__pycache__/
*.pyc
runs/scratch-*
